# Krang & Shredder: the attack half of "enter or attack", and the disappear condition. Bot1 pays {4}{U/B}{U/B} with five Moxen and a Swamp, so nothing leaves the battlefield and at the end step of
# turn 1 no card is cast: the Grizzly Bears exiled when it entered stays exiled. On turn 3 it attacks, and each opponent exiles from the top of their library until a nonland card (the Island
# of turn 2's draw having gone to hand, the Lightning Bolt is on top): Bot2 takes 6, and at the end step still nothing has left, so the Bolt is not cast either.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Krang & Shredder
Swamp
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Island
Grizzly Bears
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x9

